Kāyena saṃvaro sādhu, sādhu vācāya saṃvaro;
Manasā saṃvaro sādhu, sādhu sabbattha saṃvaro;
Sabbattha saṃvuto bhikkhu, sabbadukkhā pamuccatīti.

මනොපුබ්බඞ්ගමා ධම්මා මනොසෙට්ඨා මනොමයා;
මනසා චෙ පදුට්ඨෙන භාසති වා කරොති වා;
තතො නං දුක්ඛමන්වෙති චක්කංව වහතො පදං.

Appamādavaggo dutiyo.
20. Appamādo amatapadaṃ, pamādo maccuno padaṃ;
appamattā na mīyanti, ye pamattā yathā matā.

“Aññā hi lābhūpanisā, aññā nibbānagāminī;
Evametaṃ abhiññāya, bhikkhu buddhassa sāvako;
Sakkāraṃ nābhinandeyya, vivekamanubrūhaye.”

Subhānupassiṁ viharantaṁ, indriyesu asaṁvutaṁ;
Bhojanamhi cāmattaññuṁ, kusītaṁ hīnavīriyaṁ;
Taṁ ve pasahati māro, vāto rukkhaṁva dubbalaṁ.

Nidhīnaṃva pavattāraṃ, yaṃ passe vajjadassinaṃ;
Niggayhavādiṃ medhāviṃ, tādisaṃ paṇḍitaṃ bhaje;
Tādisaṃ bhajamānassa, seyyo hoti na pāpiyo.

Māse māse sahassena,
yo yajetha sataṃ samaṃ;
Ekañca bhāvitatthānaṃ,
muhuttamapi pūjaye;
Sāyeva pūjanā seyyo,
yañce vassasataṃ hutaṃ.

Rāgadosā ayaṃ pajā;
Tasmā hi vītarāgesu,
dinnaṃ hoti mahapphalaṃ.

Anūpavādo anūpaghāto, pātimokkhe ca saṃvaro;
Mattaññutā ca bhattasmiṃ, pantañca sayanāsanaṃ;
Adhicitte ca āyogo, etaṃ buddhāna sāsanaṃ.

Yassāsavā parikkhīṇā, āhāre ca anissito;
suññato animitto ca, vimokkho yassa gocaro;
ākāseva sakuntānaṁ, padaṁ tassa durannayaṁ.

Attanā hi kataṃ pāpaṃ, attanā saṃkilissati;
Attanā akataṃ pāpaṃ, attanāva visujjhati;
Suddhī asuddhī paccattaṃ, nāñño aññaṃ visodhaye.

Gahakāraka diṭṭhosi,
puna gehaṃ na kāhasi;
Sabbā te phāsukā bhaggā,
gahakūṭaṃ visaṅkhataṃ;
Visaṅkhāragataṃ cittaṃ,
taṇhānaṃ khayamajjhagā.

Duppabbajjaṃ durabhiramaṃ,
durāvāsā gharā dukhā;
Dukkho’samānasaṃvāso,
dukkhānupatitaddhagū;
Tasmā na c’addhagū siyā,
na ca dukkhānupatito siyā.

Yogā ve jāyatī bhūri, ayogā bhūrisaṅkhayo;
Etaṃ dvedhāpathaṃ ñatvā, bhavāya vibhavāya ca;
Tathāttānaṃ niveseyya, yathā bhūri pavaḍḍhati.
